          "location": "sitting-room"
        },
        {
          "turn": 3,
          "round": 7,
          "text": "Vera said calmly that she expected it was the spaniel, because Mr. Nuttel had told her of a horror of dogs after being hunted into a cemetery by pariah dogs on the banks of the Ganges and spending the night in a newly dug grave; no such thing was said to her: she made it up on the spot.",
